# Place .gif files here.
#
# Record terminal output from each example:
#
#   asciinema rec gifs/<name>.cast --command "./flow run examples/<name>.flow"
#   agg gifs/<name>.cast gifs/<name>.gif
#
# Each gif should be 800x600 or smaller, under 5 MB.
#
# Expected files:
#   iris_classification.gif
#   regression_demo.gif
#   grid_search_demo.gif
#   full_demo.gif
#   new_modules_demo.gif
#   clustering_demo.gif
#   ensemble_comparison.gif
#   svm_demo.gif
#   preprocessing_demo.gif
